    "name": "LEMS SCNMTC Backend",
    "description": "LEMS SCNMTC backend API. Start the API (php artisan serve) and seed the demo users (php artisan db:seed --class=DemoUsersSeeder), pick the 'LEMS local' environment, run 'Sign in as...' then any request: the token is saved automatically. The OpenAPI spec (docs/api/openapi.json) is the source of truth; if this collection disagrees with it, the spec wins. Demo accounts are synthetic and exist in the local environment only.",
